{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-04_end","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-04","title":"沒人在家","storyCode":"5-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"9ccd2c9125c5898272ee8be0e4c75e5552424f6ee69782189848192661f0b682","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"所有整合運動我都逮住了。根本沒人知道具體的指令，剛他們說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳？看什麼呢，這麼入迷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡以前是不是大學道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？是啊。後來改了名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......這似乎是我家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_4_door"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你的公寓不是在太埔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我生父一族的宅邸，好像重新裝修過了。時間過去這麼久，我甚至沒能認出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你去維多利亞讀書之前住這？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然早前聽過你和魏先生一樣是炎國貴族出身，不過，這宅子可確實夠大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"貴族？他們是，我不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"但你這屋邸擺在這......該怎麼稱呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，陳府......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"進來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，這不是你自己家門嗎，你就這麼切開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒帶鑰匙。整合運動剛剛也在側牆上開過洞了，他們造成了些意外的破壞也是有可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你說是——算了，那就是吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_home"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不用脫鞋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這真行嗎？老陳，認真回答我，你是不是有點討厭你爸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他不配當我父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒記錯，你從維多利亞畢業以後，一回龍門就直接進了近衛局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候我住宿舍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你一次也沒回來過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我對這裡沒有一點留戀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一般嘴上這麼說的人，心裡頭的事情多得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你對那個什麼高價值目標，有頭緒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"又沉浸在自己的小世界裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳，門口等你，走的時候叫我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"玩具要擺放整齊。\n不准走出家門。\n和別人說話要經過允許。\n沒同意前不准直視大人的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_home"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"居然一直有在打掃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，一直空著這個房間留給我，真夠寬容的，還是說覺得我是掃把星？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，照片，對，照片......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"你得不到我的愛，一點也得不到。\n對不起，很對不起，但我無法忍受你，光是看到你，我都恨到想要抓破自己的胳膊。\n你們都讓我無法忍受。我太自私了，我確實沒法再堅持下去了。\n你們會明白的，總有一天。要恨就恨吧。我恨你，你也恨我。那是最好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_photo"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為已經丟了，這麼早的照片......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不對......他們難道在找這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，整合運動究竟在做什麼？難道你的大腦也出問題了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定會幫你，但你在想什麼？為什麼是現在，為什麼是這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......也是。你不會回答我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你終於出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"有頭緒了？還要再玩會兒毛線球什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有心思開玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得你心情比剛才好上了那麼一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你說的，也許我有些頭緒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，根據報告，周遭的整合運動確實潰散了，原先分配好的警力正在驅趕他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。我們的道路又暢通了一些，也更接近目標了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局諸位，整隊出發！讓我們去把龍門拿回來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]}]}
